# This repository publishes RELEASES ONLY - the packaged mod, not the Unreal
# project it is built from. The source lives in the cooked editor SDK project
# and is deliberately kept out of here.
#
# These patterns are a safety net: if a source folder is ever copied or dragged
# in by accident, it cannot be committed without someone noticing.
*.uasset
*.umap
*.bak
Content/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
*.uproject
*.sln

# The packaged mod itself is NOT ignored - the .pak/.ucas/.utoc trio belongs in
# the release, and may be committed here too if a copy in the tree is wanted.

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
